ars he  reported to have loaned his campaign a  claim that went unchecked in the radio  interview Monday the seven hundred  thousand dollars you put into the  election was that your money  that is the money of that I've paid  myself through my company the vulner  organizations understood  despite the admission Santos said he  won't be deterred from serving his full  term in Congress and said he intends to  deliver on the promises he made during  the campaign Trail he is slated to be  sworn into Congress next week Nate  Caitlin thank you
 

